Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for submitting your financial guarantee to Admission Services. Your documents have been received and will soon be reviewed.

Please allow three to five business days to see this task removed from your My ASU Priority Tasks list at http://my.asu.edu.

If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

